Package: uzunyx-colors
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.7)
Recommends: uzunyx-terminal
Description: Uzunyx color schemes (Akane and Sora)
 Two dark KDE color schemes for the Uzunyx desktop that share the same
 blue-grey neutrals and differ only in their accent: Uzunyx Akane
 (crimson, matching the Uzunyx logo) and Uzunyx Sora
 (cyan). GTK applications follow them through kde-gtk-config. Also Konsole
 color schemes and profiles for both editions.
